Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:59:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 30/37] Repeat guard: retries sample at temperature 0.8, up to
 two, and a draft still repeating becomes a short 'already covered' turn

The guard's A/B found a retry at temperature 0 returns the same text and was accepted as the
draft. Now the repeat check runs on every draft, retries are hot, and after two the turn says it
already covered that instead of resending it. Still behind SEQUENCE_TEACH_REPEAT_GUARD=1.
---
 packages/analyzer/src/server/askPipeline.ts   | 47 ++++++++++++++-----
 .../analyzer/src/test/ask-tool-loop.test.ts   | 33 +++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

